================================================================
  musil: library reference (plot)
================================================================

--- building ---
title   : two sines
layers  : 3 ; kinds: (line line scatter)
options : ((xlabel sample) (ylabel value) (ymin -1.5) (ymax 1.5))
a layer : (line x y ... sin)
save-png with a size: 1

--- layer kinds ---
line, scatter, bars : x y label (x may be nil for 0, 1, 2, ...)
image               : a matrix as a heat map, row 0 at the bottom
surface             : a matrix as a 3D surface, drag or arrow keys to orbit
wrote bars, image, surface: (1 1 1)

--- one-call helpers (they show; here MUSIL_NOSHOW may be set) ---
plot plot-xy plot-lines scatter bars image surface: shown

--- ready-made ---
waveform        : waveform (line)
spectrum        : spectrum (dB against Hz)
spectrogram     : spectrogram ; image of 128 bins x 59 frames
histogram-figure: histogram 5 bars
scatter-clusters: 2 layers, one per cluster
wrote waveform and spectrogram: 1 1

--- errors ---
empty figure    : plot.mu:16: save-png: figure: no layers
length mismatch : plot.mu:36: save-png: figure: line: x and y must have the same length
unknown option  : plot.mu:43: save-png: figure: unknown option nope

================================================================
  end of plot reference
================================================================
